      "115.9b",
      "608.2b"
    ],
    "note": "XMage TargetsPermanentPredicate consults battlefield LKI, but CR115.9b expressly ignores departed targets for a spell that targets something. This implementation uses current live exact target incarnations, current controller and current artifact/creature types; it does not use LKI. A spell whose sole qualifying target is the sacrificed Droid can become an illegal target when this ability resolves."
